LCC report style with markdown frontmatter. Be concise but thorough.\", 'temperature': 0.3}}, {'op': 'add_node', 'id': 'write_report', 'name': 'Write Individual Report', 'node_type': 'tool_operator', 'config': {'tool': 'file_write', 'config': {'path': \"content/blogs/equity-research/{{item.ticker}}/{{formatDate(now(), 'yyyy-MM-dd')}}/index.md\", 'content': '{{analyze_generate.output}}'}}}]}": {
